# Little fairy wings on the duck's back, a sheen by checkerboard dither (never partial alpha), a
# vein down each wing. bee-wings-0 (raised) and bee-wings-1 (flicked back) flutter. Drawn behind
# the body (the -back frames); the front frames are empty. Back items hang on the neck anchor.
name: bee-wings
size: 25x19
anchor: neck 24 17
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  L #dff9fb
  V #95afc0
  W #ffffff

